KinnowIsland_Text_1:
	.string "I love the diversity on the KINNOW\n"
	.string "ISLANDS.\p"
	.string "There is a small city on this\n"
	.string "island, but there is also a lot of\l"
	.string "nature to be found.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_2:
	.string "Getting older is not so bad as\n"
	.string "long as you stay healthy.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_3:
	.string "Some islands on ROUTE G and H are\n"
	.string "also part of the KINNOW ISLANDS.\p"
	.string "Most people live around here, that\n"
	.string "is why people often refer to this\l"
	.string "island when they talk about KINNOW\l"
	.string "ISLAND.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_4:
	.string "CLEFABLE is my favorite POKéMON!\p"
	.string "I heard one is performing on the\n"
	.string "POKéMON SHOWBOAT.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_5:
	.string "I heard they currently have a\n"
	.string "voice-actor show on the POKéMON\l"
	.string "SHOWBOAT.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_6:
	.string "To enter the POKéMON SHOWBOAT\n"
	.string "you’ll need a SHOWBOAT PASS.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_7:
	.string "The POKéMON SHOWBOAT is a great\n"
	.string "place to work for me and my\l"
	.string "colleagues.\p"
	.string "When we’re docked there is not a\n"
	.string "lot of work to do.\p"
	.string "Therefore most of my colleagues\n"
	.string "are resting in their cabins.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_8:
	.string "I can’t wait to see the\n"
	.string "voice-acting show!$"

KinnowIsland_Text_9:
	.string "TRAINER TIPS\p"
	.string "FULL HEAL cures all ailments like\n"
	.string "burns, paralysis, poisoning,\l"
	.string "freezing, and sleep.\p"
	.string "It costs a bit more, but it’s more\n"
	.string "convenient than buying other items.$"

KinnowIsland_Text_10:
	.string "KINNOW ISLAND \n"
	.string "A Cultural Center$"
